<section class="pkg-faq-band">
  <div class="container">
    <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
    <div class="pkg-faq">
      <details><summary>Do you only work near Northampton?</summary><p>No. We are based in Northampton and arrange moves across the UK. Local moves in Northamptonshire are covered on our <a href="/northampton/">Northampton page</a>.</p></details>
      <details><summary>How do viewings and moving day work if I live a long way from Northampton?</summary><p>Where possible, viewings and key moving-day tasks are scheduled together, and your coordinator manages the rest of the process remotely, so nothing depends on a short-notice site visit.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Can you help with retirement developments and age-restricted communities?</summary><p>We can plan the move around the application steps, service charges and access rules a development involves. See our page on <a href="/retirement-village-moving-service/">moving to a retirement village or home</a>.</p></details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

